ASoC: codecs: restore Linux 7.3 LPASS PM clock management

Undo the four 060[1-4] BurninChrome clock-management reverts. They
keep macro/dcodec voted during runtime suspend, preventing CX collapse.
Pair with the SoundWire IRQ synchronization fix; audio needs hardware
regression testing. Restores these four files byte-for-byte to v7.3.

